Package: board-local
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Board maintainers <tomharmon@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/tomharmon/board
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libgcc-s1, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd, xdg-desktop-portal
Suggests: ffmpeg
Description: Local SQLite message board for people and agents
 Includes the board command-line client, MCP server and native Rune desktop app.
